sub1:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-overall> .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Kavanagh et al. (2013) phalangeal Inhibitory Cascade & Hiscock et al. (2017) BMP-GDF5-Noggin synovial joint interzone segmentation — MorphoEval overall 54.4/100" ;
        dcterms:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dcterms:description "Pass 1 (v1) baseline evaluation of `2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py` (overall weighted score: 56.4/100). The v1 script computes the 2x2 GDF5-Noggin Turing dispersion curve, evaluates the analytical Kavanagh et al. (2013) Inhibitory Cascade line P2/P1 = 1/2 + (1/2)(P3/P1), and plots a 1D wild-type 3-joint profile, but lacks a growing-domain 1D/2D reaction-diffusion PDE solver with distal PFR-FGF wavefront modulation, omits the Nog-/-, Gdf5 bp/bp, Wnt9a, and zero-diffusion perturbation controls, and never loads or segments the vendored tetrapod digit radiograph specimen image. Overall 54.4/100 (faithfulness 47.7, reproducibility 70.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 45d4150; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 58, Morphological realism / specimen match 35, Parameter expressivity 48, Morphometric validation 55, Source and data traceability 74, Code-to-model traceability 68, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/joint_interzone_clefting_comparison.png: rendered output of 2016-onuff-joint-interzone-clefting.py at 45d4150, image/png, 273318 B, 1890×1288 px, artifact_sha256 15ba94051c8a36f0c3c01d6d4a2dbafc88a708722e10040af439ebb53c466be0 (sha256 15ba94051c8a36f0c3c01d6d4a2dbafc88a708722e10040af439ebb53c466be0), spec_fingerprint 56e3e114fc02325ea6b391f130fabc0038842bfdf81e75272cec62c77030adae. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 56e3e114fc02325ea6b391f130fabc0038842bfdf81e75272cec62c77030adae; artifact_sha256: 15ba94051c8a36f0c3c01d6d4a2dbafc88a708722e10040af439ebb53c466be0; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/joint_interzone_clefting/joint_interzone_clefting_reference.json=9acd7913813a1a7b..., datasets/joint_interzone_clefting/paper_citations.bib=4d966fca533780af..., datasets/joint_interzone_clefting/scout_manifest.json=1ae24e293d2062b2..., datasets/joint_interzone_clefting/tetrapod_digit_interzone_specimen.jpg=995e43a2a0cf7815...}." ;
        dcterms:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add runtime SHA-256 verification of all 4 files in `datasets/joint_interzone_clefting/`, expose full CLI parameter overrides (`--noggin-dose`, `--gdf5-dose`, `--alpha-taper`, `--D-ratio`, `--seed`), and expand `measure_morphoeval()` to 9 metrics and `self_test()` to 8 comprehensive checks.",
            "remediation needed: Implement a growing-domain 1D and 2D chondrogenic digit-ray reaction-diffusion PDE solver for GDF5/Wnt9a and Noggin modulated by a distal Phalanx-Forming Region (PFR) FGF8 gradient alongside the zero-diffusion (D_G = D_N = 0) negative control.",
            "remediation needed: Implement computer-vision axial intensity profile segmentation of `datasets/joint_interzone_clefting/tetrapod_digit_interzone_specimen.jpg` across Digits II, III, and IV to detect the radiolucent MCP, PIP, and DIP synovial joint interzone clefts and quantify empirical phalanx lengths P1, P2, P3 and P2/(P1+P2+P3) against the 1/3 Inhibitory Cascade law.",
            "remediation needed: Simulate all 6 genetic and developmental perturbation conditions (Wild-Type 3 joints, Nog-/- complete joint fusion 0 joints, Gdf5 bp/bp proximal PIP fusion 2 joints, Wnt9a ectopic overexpression 4 joints, sustained PFR-FGF equal-length phalanges, and D=0 ablation control) and evaluate the 12-taxon cross-clade Kavanagh et al. (2013) Inhibitory Cascade morphospace regression." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.544"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 018 Pass 1 Assessor)" ;
        dcterms:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf orcid:0009-0007-4948-9192 ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

